{"id":"mitad","lemma":"mitad","pos":"noun","rank":534,"glosses":["half"],"ipa":"/miˈtad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mitades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/98/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-mitad.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Quiere usted la mitad de este pastel?","en":"Do you want half of this cake?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522058","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"pastry"}]},{"text":"Necesito sólo la mitad.","en":"I only need half.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442785","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},null,{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Puedo hacerlo en la mitad de tiempo.","en":"I can do it in half the time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333129","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"No has escuchado ni la mitad todavía.","en":"You haven't heard the half of it yet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703518","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to listen to","l":"escuchar"},{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"still, yet"}]},{"text":"La mitad de ustedes son idiotas.","en":"Half of you are idiots.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"you all"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"idiot","l":"idiota"}]}]}